### Get All Specifications and Skills
### This file contains endpoints to retrieve all specifications and skills with pagination and search

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================
### GET ALL SKILLS
### ============================================
### Retrieve all skills with pagination and optional search
### Query Parameters:
###   - page: Page number (default: 1)
###   - limit: Items per page (default: 100, max: 100)
###   - search: Search term to filter skills by name (optional)

### Get All Skills (Default - First Page, 100 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get All Skills with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get All Skills with Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills?page=1&limit=10&search=javascript
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get All Skills - Second Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/skills?page=2&limit=20
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "items": [
###       {
###         "id": "uuid-here",
###         "name": "JavaScript",
###         "specificationId": "uuid-here",
###         "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###         "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
###       }
###     ],
###     "pagination": {
###       "page": 1,
###       "limit": 10,
###       "total": 100,
###       "totalPages": 10,
###       "hasNext": true,
###       "hasPrev": false
###     }
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### GET ALL SPECIFICATIONS
### ============================================
### Retrieve all specifications with pagination and optional search
### Query Parameters:
###   - page: Page number (default: 1)
###   - limit: Items per page (default: 100, max: 100)
###   - search: Search term to filter specifications by name (optional)

### Get All Specifications (Default - First Page, 100 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/specifications
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get All Specifications with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/specifications?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get All Specifications with Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/specifications?page=1&limit=10&search=web
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Get All Specifications - Second Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/specifications?page=2&limit=20
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Response Example:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "items": [
###       {
###         "id": "uuid-here",
###         "name": "Web Development",
###         "icon": "web-icon.svg",
###         "createdAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
###         "updatedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
###       }
###     ],
###     "pagination": {
###       "page": 1,
###       "limit": 10,
###       "total": 50,
###       "totalPages": 5,
###       "hasNext": true,
###       "hasPrev": false
###     }
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### NOTES:
### ============================================
### 1. Pagination:
###    - Both endpoints support pagination via query parameters
###    - page: Page number (starts from 1, default: 1)
###    - limit: Number of items per page (default: 100, max: 100)
###    - If limit exceeds 100, it will be capped at 100
###
### 2. Search:
###    - Optional search parameter to filter results
###    - Search is case-insensitive
###    - Searches in the name field for both skills and specifications
###    - Example: ?search=javascript will find skills/specs with "javascript" in the name
###
### 3. Response Format:
###    - Both endpoints return a consistent response structure
###    - Contains "items" array with the actual data
###    - Contains "pagination" object with pagination metadata
###    - Pagination includes: page, limit, total, totalPages, hasNext, hasPrev
###
### 4. Public Access:
###    - Both endpoints are publicly accessible (no authentication required)
###    - No Authorization header needed
###
### 5. Query Parameter Examples:
###    - Default: GET /api/skills (page=1, limit=100)
###    - Paginated: GET /api/skills?page=2&limit=20
###    - With Search: GET /api/skills?page=1&limit=10&search=react
###    - Combined: GET /api/skills?page=1&limit=50&search=node
